DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260825
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260826
SUMMARY:Breakfast: Biscuit w Gravy\, Sausage (fresh) / Biscuit w Gravy (fre
 sh) / Cereal Variety
DESCRIPTION:\nBiscuit w Gravy\, Sausage (fresh)\n    \n \n    \nBiscuit w 
 Gravy (fresh)\n    \n \n    \nCereal Variety\n    \n \n    \nOne breakfa
 st is available to all students at no cost. All meals are served with frui
 t variety and 1% low-fat or non-fat chocolate milk (soy milk available upo
 n request). Students must choose at least one fruit option. All grains off
 ered are whole grain rich. Menu subject to change based on product availab
 ility.\n    \nThis institution is an equal opportunity provider.\n
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
